        "description": "The Alabama Shakes released their first full-length album, “Boys & Girls” in 2012, to near-universal praise. Fronted by lead singer and guitarist Brittany Howard, the group is known for merging classic American blues rock with a healthy twang of southern soul. Howard also released her debut solo album, \"Jaime\", in 2019, and is also the lead vocalist, guitarist and songwriter of Thunderbitch. (Photo: Rovi)",
