    {
      "id": "e6dbab95-cf8b-4e05-bb2a-82e06a1b38b4",
      "type": "playlists",
      "attributes": {
        "name": "Primal Scream Essentials",
        "description": "Since making their debut in 1987 with ‘Sonic Flower Groove,’ Primal Scream has refused to be pigeonholed, consistently confounding listeners with disparate sounds born of their genre-defying approach. Over the course of eleven albums, the band has dipped its collective toe into the waters of electronica, shoegaze, indie pop, neo-psychedelia, alternative rock and more, lead through it all by consummate frontman Bobby Gillespie. Featuring tracks from ‘Screamadelica’ (1991), ‘XTRMNTR’ (2000), ‘Chaosmosis’ (2016) and more, enjoy this Primal Scream sampler. (Photo: Rovi)",
